ou report it through Steam forum or by email at info@lemonygames.com. This would be helpful to make the demo and the ful","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-06T16:51:43Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314342549","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:12:06Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4586410-1839676055892586","game_id":"steam-4586410","kind":"announcement","title":"The Little Crumb Demo v0.2.1","summary":"Hey there 🥐The demo is not public yet, but some of you already have access to it. This patch is more about clarifying gameplay and showing players what they can do.If you encounter any other bug, it would still help a lot if you report it through Steam forum or by email at info@lemonygames.com. This would be helpful to make the demo and the full game as good as possible.Thank you 💛 UIAdded customer patience and customer visits percentages in the Skill Tree UI.Added names of newly discovered reci","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-02T13:00:14Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055892586","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:12:06Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4586410-1833968530898159","game_id":"steam-4586410","kind":"announcement","title":"Playtest is LIVE! (until June 16th)","summary":"Hey hey! I'm super excited to announce that the first Steam Playtest is now LIVE! So please, check it out and don't forget to share it with your friends. This is an early build of the Demo, so expect some bugs, and a lot of work-in-progress content. Playtest Content6 levels, each introducing a new baking recipe.12 different upgrades to improve your shop.Customize your character's face.Meet Flora and Trudy, and serve the other customers of The Little Crumb. Give us 